     1371        SIZE 35 BY 1.19 NO-UNDO.
     1372   DEFINE FRAME F-Main
     1373        inv-shift-start AT ROW 3.14 COL 7 COLON-ALIGNED
     1374        inv-shift-end AT ROW 3.14 COL 26.8 COLON-ALIGNED
     1375        BUTTON-Shift-end AT ROW 3.14 COL 32 WIDGET-ID 14
     1376        BUTTON-Shift-Start AT ROW 3.19 COL 12.4 WIDGET-ID 12
     1377        inv-date-start AT ROW 4.33 COL 7 COLON-ALIGNED WIDGET-ID 6
     1378        inv-date-end AT ROW 4.33 COL 26.8 COLON-ALIGNED WIDGET-ID 8
     1379        tog-only-itog AT ROW 6.71 COL 3.6 WIDGET-ID 2
     1380        "Период для расчёта данных по инвентаризации :" VIEW-AS TEXT
     1381             SIZE 51.6 BY .95 AT ROW 1.48 COL 3.4 WIDGET-ID 4
     1382        RECT-8 AT ROW 6.62 COL 2
     1383        RECT-9 AT ROW 1.24 COL 2 WIDGET-ID 10
     1384       WITH 1 DOWN NO-BOX KEEP-TAB-ORDER OVERLAY
     1385            SIDE-LABELS NO-UNDERLINE THREE-D
